    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Haddo Rook</strong> is the ropewright and line-splicer for the Lower market's overhead bone trolleys: a big, slow, cheerful, very literal man whose two arms came from two different lawful donors. He measures everything in arm-lengths and says which arm.</p><p><strong>GM notes (Part 7).</strong> [SECRET] Paid Thaw specialist: braids the line and knows nothing else. T6 braid: Dexterity (weaver's tools or Sleight of Hand) DC 12. Two of his iron bars carry a Hunger trace (T2, Analyze DC 12). Optional job: the fraying cable, 10 gp, Athletics DC 12 aloft.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
      "alignment": "neutral",
