    {
      "_id": "e30b2eab2f1a1b20",
      "name": "Side Quest: The Fraying Cable",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Side Quest: The Fraying Cable (optional)</h2><p><strong>Hook:</strong> a trolley cable is fraying above the market. Haddo pays <strong>10 gp</strong> for a hand.</p><ul><li>Go aloft on the rails and hold the cable while Haddo splices: Athletics <strong>DC 12</strong> aloft.</li><li>Failure: a slip and a dangle (no fall if roped in); Haddo hauls them up and the splice takes another half hour.</li><li>Nan Gristle holds the trolleys while they work, loudly.</li></ul><p><strong>Reward:</strong> 10 gp, and Haddo's good opinion (useful for T6).</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
